{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>資訊節目《東張西望》日前揭露一宗醫療爭議，有癌症患者誤信中介遠赴日本接受未經證實細胞免疫療法，豪擲巨款後病情反急速惡化。事件曝光後牽扯出另一宗涉及百萬港元醫療悲劇，有家屬控訴因觀看資深藝人主持網上頻道而步上同一條赴日求醫之路。涉事健康資訊平台目前已緊急將相關推廣影片全數下架作冷處理。鼻咽癌患張先生赴...</p>\n<p>資訊節目《東張西望》日前揭露一宗醫療爭議，有癌症患者誤信中介遠赴日本接受未經證實細胞免疫療法，豪擲巨款後病情反急速惡化。事件曝光後牽扯出另一宗涉及百萬港元醫療悲劇，有家屬控訴因觀看資深藝人主持網上頻道而步上同一條赴日求醫之路。涉事健康資訊平台目前已緊急將相關推廣影片全數下架作冷處理。</p>\n<h2>鼻咽癌患張先生赴日打針耗250萬病情急劇惡化</h2>\n<p>據《東張西望》專題報道所述，張先生於2022年確診初期鼻咽癌，因恐懼常規治療副作用而在2024年初接觸到推介細胞免疫治療中介公司。赴日接受打針療程期間，張先生病情不僅未見起色，更出現狂流鼻血等嚴重症狀，當時中介負責人竟向其誆稱此乃「排死癌細胞」客觀現象。張先生前後被索取高達250萬港元，最終決定及時止損回港接受傳統癌症常規治療，才得以勉強保住性命。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378486524657743_15943613536aeafc217c6f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"b7-87LSiHaErkM7fqvF6D4I00P665YKIiMFejYjBXo0.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378486524657743_15943613536aeafc217c6f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378486683790695_19246839476aeafc232038b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"b1MQ1csg8_-KLWDEziPRoB-rqaGErVjW8rrOA_K6zgM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378486683790695_19246839476aeafc232038b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>鄭丹瑞《健康旦》捲入醫療風波惹議急刪除片段</h2>\n<p>醫療風波持續發酵並波及資深藝人鄭丹瑞旗下YouTube健康資訊頻道《健康旦》，有苦主家屬踢爆正因為觀看該節目介紹才約見同一名女中介赴日求醫。面對公眾強烈抨擊與質疑，《健康旦》目前已將涉事女中介專訪影片緊急下架移除以平息眾議。與此同時，另一在日港人夫婦YouTuber頻道《JoyTV》亦被翻出曾大力宣傳該項日本細胞免疫治療，當時影片更標榜「復發率低至20%甚至係『0』！」，令不少癌症患者誤以為尋獲救命稻草。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378486868513606_12362579846aeafc24defe0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"X-iP9--mupM8r6TzV6ceb9qmZNm53hrnHVP56R1T-ek.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378486868513606_12362579846aeafc24defe0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378487027828366_3575380176aeafc2684d68.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"cVx-eQQNqWKMtjtNau3nL637fkH6n_XAJ-rcTifq3E4.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378487027828366_3575380176aeafc2684d68.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378487183431286_12109716246aeafc28181d4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"n_7iMxqAfiZvEAzPpnsKHoYfUNr7lrDb6tJFa-rSRWs.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378487183431286_12109716246aeafc28181d4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>網民家屬看《健康旦》赴日治療耗百萬返港病逝</h2>\n<p>該起事件牽扯出另一宗令人心酸悲劇，有網民於社交平台Threads發長文揭露家人慘痛經歷。該名家屬早在2024年觀看《健康旦》後暫停香港常規治療，赴日後發現治療場所並非正規醫院，患者平日只能居住酒店，見醫生及治療全程依賴中介日語翻譯。治療期間中介與醫生不斷以病情有變為由要求加碼，頻密推銷注射幹細胞針及各類產品，病人最終花費超過100萬港元健康卻急轉直下，險些無法登機，返港落機後由救護車直入瑪麗醫院離世。</p>\n<h2>大批網民怒轟無良中介向絕望病患牟利行為可恥</h2>\n<p>醫療爭議曝光後迅速引爆全城關注，大批網民紛紛於各大社交平台留言痛批中介良心何在，直指「用人哋嘅健康同希望去呃人更加罪大惡極」。不少留言狠斥公眾人物與KOL為了賺錢接商案推廣未獲臨床證實療法等同變相害人，感嘆「太多人向絕望的人牟利」。有網民分享防癌協會曾指出該類細胞免疫治療理論與實際臨床效果存在巨大差距，並無充足臨床數據證明具抗癌療效，呼籲大眾切勿盡信網上推廣片段，身體抱恙務必尋求專科醫生專業意見。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378487332863736_14957146536aeafc298e69a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bZ71F44_DB-0YVVOMvukVCfFN_m8udpHen5ainp-Woo.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378487332863736_14957146536aeafc298e69a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378487566821815_6255497976aeafc2bdc719.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Nwc8L6ynuZCg15oTDIU5Vol4apD-16otE3TZhhN02YY.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378487566821815_6255497976aeafc2bdc719.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378487728711937_185899406aeafc2d7d8c0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"4RAsvbakzRGlH4dkaepOHOewCRh1HkqBXW-6I11vuiM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179378487728711937_185899406aeafc2d7d8c0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937848788237880_19589749796aeafc2f1eb2d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"aSNkpJndC66oVt6lzxj-aP42vcqRhG0UqhfHrKoXx6w.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17937848788237880_19589749796aeafc2f1eb2d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T09:45:40.044731+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1504,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:34:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:18:56.295290+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:43.060412+00:00","content_hash":"fde4514ead513ed7cc097f411ea432fe0fc522113b2348a71967331a135e214a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}